{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42304","headline":"再领制诰和王明府见贺 · 徐铉","name":"再领制诰和王明府见贺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹇步还依列宿边，拱辰重认旧云天。\n自嗟多难飘零困，不似当年胆气全。\n鸡树晚花疎向日，龙池轻浪细含烟。\n从来不解爲身计，一叶悠悠任大川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}